---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import mobilePrototype from '@assets/images/mobile-prototype.png';
---

<div class="grid grid-flow-row gap-y-4 lg:grid-cols-12 w-full">
  <div class="w-auto mx-auto row-start-2 lg:row-start-1 lg:col-span-6">
    <div
      class="w-full p-3 aspect-square rounded-lg border border-opacity-50 border-primary_dark bg-gradient-to-br from-transparent via-primary_dark/5 to-transparent"
    >
      <Image
        src={mobilePrototype}
        alt="three mobile prototypes of a pet themed shopify store"
        width="500"
        height="500"
        class="object-contain bg-accent_dark h-full w-full rounded-md opacity-100"
      />
    </div>
  </div>

  <div
    class="max-w-[500px] mx-auto lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-8 flex flex-col items-start"
  >
    <small
      class="font-ubuntu_mono text-base py-0 px-2 my-auto mb-4 rounded border-2 border-accent_dark"
    >
      some text
    </small>
    <h4 class="mb-4">The title text</h4>
    <p>
      Reprehenderit dolor ad ea consequat culpa nulla ex quis. Ex laborum sint
      id duis id laboris consequat aliquip deserunt non dolor culpa fugiat
      excepteur. Minim tempor sint dolor ea. Duis sunt eu laborum Lorem fugiat
      exercitation ipsum anim in reprehenderit elit est eu. Officia fugiat culpa
      enim aute Lorem commodo qui officia fugiat aliquip pariatur consequat
      occaecat nulla. Qui aliquip aute mollit commodo amet fugiat. Irure eiusmod
      reprehenderit ad amet quis non amet.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
